  "aliases": [],
  "summary": "从右侧滑进来一整页内容，铺满整个高度，背后页面被压暗、暂时不能操作；看完关闭就回到原来那一页。适合列表项详情和编辑这类需要临时「离开一下」的场景。",
  "usage": "列表项详情、编辑表单这类需要「临时离开当前页」的场景：从右侧滑入完整一屏内容，遮罩压暗原页面、下层不可操作，宽 380–420。",
  "caution": "只在列表上顺手调筛选/设置时用「侧滑抽屉」（薄纱不压暗、浮动面板）；原页面要保持并排可操作时用「并排滑入面板」；移动端改用整页路由或底部面板。",
  "hint": "点「详情」，子页面从右侧滑入",
  "inspiration": "",
  "prompt": "【侧滑子页面】目标：列表项详情 / 编辑这类「临时离开当前页」的场景，从右侧滑入一整页内容，遮罩压暗原页面、下层不可操作。\n\n1) 结构：.page 原页面 + .scrim 遮罩 + aside.panel > .ph 标题栏 + .pb 内容区。\n\n2) **和「侧滑抽屉」的区别**（最容易做重，必须写进实现）：\n   - 子页面 = 页面级：遮罩 46% + blur 1px，原页面压暗且不可操作；**贴边全高**（top/right/bottom:0）；宽 380；内容是一整屏（详情、编辑、底部危险操作）。\n   - 抽屉 = 页面内工具面板：薄纱 10% 不 blur，原页面仍可读；**四周留白 12px + 圆角 14px** 浮在页面上；宽 300；底部是「重置 / 应用」。\n   - 判断标准：要「进去看一整个东西」用子页面，只是在列表上顺手调一下用抽屉；要两者并排可操作时用「并排滑入面板」。\n\n3) 动画：panel 默认 translateX(102%)，打开归位，0.32 秒 cubic-bezier(.22,.8,.26,1)；遮罩 opacity 0.26 秒 ease。\n\n4) 滚动条：.pb 是 overflow:auto，必须自绘细滚动条（10px、`::-webkit-scrollbar-button{display:none}` 去箭头、thumb 用 text 色 30%、hover 50%、`@supports not selector(::-webkit-scrollbar)` 才给 scrollbar-width 兜底）。**不要在主选择器上写 scrollbar-width**——写了 Chromium 会整体忽略 webkit 伪元素，退回带箭头的系统滚动条。\n\n5) 交互：点列表项「详情」打开并按项填充内容；点 ✕、遮罩、Esc 关闭；关闭后焦点回到触发按钮。\n\n6) 无障碍：role=\"dialog\" + aria-modal=\"true\" + aria-label；关闭按钮 aria-label；面板可聚焦（tabindex 需在打开时移焦）。\n\n7) 配色：只用 --ui-*；危险操作按钮用 --ui-danger 描边而不是实底。\n\n8) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 里循环；首轮延迟 300 毫秒；光标点「详情」→ 面板滑入 → 移到 ✕ → 关闭 → cursor.hide()。\n\n9) 使用场景：见 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{margin:0;overflow:hidden;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg)}\n\n.page{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:16px 18px}\n.bar{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px}\n.bar b{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.bar span{font-size:11px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:2px;min-width:0}\n.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:9px 11px;border-radius:11px;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);min-width:0}\n.ava{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;flex:0 0 auto;\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 24%,var(--ui-surface)),color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 8%,var(--ui-surface)))}\n.row .name{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}\n.row .role{font-size:11px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);margin-right:auto;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.more{border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface-2);color:var(--ui-text);font:inherit;font-size:11px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer;flex:0 0 auto;transition:transform .12s ease,border-color .15s ease}\n.more:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 40%,var(--ui-border))}\n.more.pressing,.more:active{transform:scale(.95)}\n\n/* 遮罩：46% + 轻模糊，刻意压暗原页面——这是「页面级子页」的特征 */\n.scrim{position:fixed;inset:0;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 46%,transparent);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(1px);backdrop-filter:blur(1px);\n  opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .26s ease;z-index:10}\n.scrim.open{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}\n\n/* 面板：贴边全高，不像抽屉那样四周留白 */\n.panel{position:fixed;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;width:380px;max-width:88%;background:var(--ui-surface);border-left:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  box-shadow:-18px 0 44px color-mix(in srgb,#000 13%,transparent);transform:translateX(102%);\n  transition:transform .32s cubic-bezier(.22,.8,.26,1);z-index:20;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n.panel.open{transform:none}\n.ph{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-border) 70%,transparent)}\n.ph b{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.x{margin-left:auto;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:8px;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim);cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-size:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;transition:transform .12s ease,background .15s ease}\n.x:hover{background:var(--ui-surface-2)}\n.x.pressing,.x:active{transform:scale(.92)}\n.pb{flex:1;min-height:0;padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;overflow:auto}\n\n/* 自绘滚动条：细、无箭头、淡色，悬停加深（复用库里的「滚动条」设计）。\n   只写 webkit 伪元素——同时写 scrollbar-width/color 会让 Chromium 整体忽略它们。 */\n.pb::-webkit-scrollbar{width:10px;height:10px}\n.pb::-webkit-scrollbar-button{display:none;width:0;height:0}\n.pb::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:transparent;margin:7px 0}\n.pb::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 30%,transparent);border:3px solid transparent;border-right-width:4px;background-clip:padding-box;border-radius:999px}\n.pb::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 50%,transparent);background-clip:padding-box}\n.pb::-webkit-scrollbar-corner{background:transparent}\n@supports not selector(::-webkit-scrollbar){\n  .pb{scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--ui-text-dim) transparent}\n}\n\n.who{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-width:0}\n.who .ava{width:38px;height:38px}\n.who b{display:block;font-size:13px}\n.who span{font-size:11px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.kv{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);min-width:0}\n.kv b{color:var(--ui-text);font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;text-align:right;min-width:0}\n.ghost{margin-top:auto;flex:0 0 auto;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-danger) 45%,var(--ui-border));background:transparent;color:var(--ui-danger);font:inherit;font-size:12px;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  .page{padding:10px 12px;gap:7px}\n  .bar b{font-size:12px}\n  .row{padding:6px 9px;border-radius:9px;gap:7px}\n  .panel{width:72%;max-width:72%}\n  .ph{padding:8px 11px}\n  .ph b{font-size:11px}\n  .x{width:22px;height:22px;font-size:11px}\n  .pb{padding:9px 11px;gap:7px;overflow:hidden}\n  .who{gap:7px}\n  .who .ava{width:24px;height:24px}\n  .who b{font-size:11px}\n  .who span{font-size:9px}\n  .kv{font-size:9px;gap:6px}\n  .ghost{padding:5px;font-size:10px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .panel,.scrim,.more,.x{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"bar\"><b>团队成员</b><span>3 人</span></div>\n  <div class=\"list\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <i class=\"ava\"></i>\n      <span class=\"name\">林小满</span><span class=\"role\">产品经理</span>\n      <button class=\"more\" data-i=\"0\" type=\"button\">详情</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <i class=\"ava\"></i>\n      <span class=\"name\">周启</span><span class=\"role\">前端</span>\n      <button class=\"more\" data-i=\"1\" type=\"button\">详情</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"scrim\" id=\"scrim\"></div>\n\n<aside class=\"panel\" id=\"panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"成员详情\">\n  <div class=\"ph\">\n    <b>成员详情</b>\n    <button class=\"x\" id=\"close\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"关闭\">✕</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pb\">\n    <div class=\"who\">\n      <i class=\"ava\"></i>\n      <div><b id=\"pName\">林小满</b><span id=\"pRole\">产品经理</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"kv\"><span>邮箱</span><b id=\"pMail\">lin@team.dev</b></div>\n    <div class=\"kv\"><span>加入时间</span><b>2025-03-12</b></div>\n    <div class=\"kv\"><span>最近活跃</span><b>2 小时前</b></div>\n    <div class=\"kv\"><span>负责模块</span><b>订单中心 · 结算</b></div>\n    <div class=\"kv\"><span>账号状态</span><b>正常</b></div>\n    <button class=\"ghost\" type=\"button\">移除成员</button>\n  </div>\n</aside>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var panel = document.getElementById('panel'),\n      scrim = document.getElementById('scrim'),\n      closeBtn = document.getElementById('close'),\n      list = document.querySelector('.list'),\n      pName = document.getElementById('pName'),\n      pRole = document.getElementById('pRole'),\n      pMail = document.getElementById('pMail');\n\n  var people = [\n    { name: '林小满', role: '产品经理', mail: 'lin@team.dev' },\n    { name: '周启', role: '前端', mail: 'zhou@team.dev' }\n  ];\n\n  var isOpen = false, timers = [], cursor = null, cursorReady = false;\n\n  function clearTimers(){\n    timers.forEach(function(t){ clearTimeout(t); });\n    timers = [];\n  }\n  function later(fn, ms){ timers.push(setTimeout(fn, ms)); }\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursorReady) return cursor;\n    cursorReady = true;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n  function showCursor(){\n    if(cursor && cursor.el) cursor.el.classList.add('show');\n  }\n\n  function fill(i){\n    var p = people[i] || people[0];\n    pName.textContent = p.name;\n    pRole.textContent = p.role;\n    pMail.textContent = p.mail;\n  }\n\n  function openPanel(i){\n    fill(i);\n    if(isOpen) return;\n    isOpen = true;\n    panel.classList.add('open');\n    scrim.classList.add('open');\n  }\n\n  function closePanel(){\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    isOpen = false;\n    panel.classList.remove('open');\n    scrim.classList.remove('open');\n  }\n\n  list.addEventListener('click', function(e){\n    var btn = e.target && e.target.closest ? e.target.closest('.more') : null;\n    if(btn) openPanel(Number(btn.getAttribute('data-i')));\n  });\n\n  closeBtn.addEventListener('click', closePanel);\n  scrim.addEventListener('click', closePanel);\n\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    if(e.key === 'Escape') closePanel();\n  });\n\n  function demoCycle(){\n    clearTimers();\n    closePanel();\n    ensureCursor();\n\n    if(!cursor){\n      later(function(){ openPanel(0); }, 500);\n      later(closePanel, 2400);\n      later(demoCycle, 3200);\n      return;\n    }\n\n    showCursor();\n    var first = list.querySelector('.more');\n    cursor.moveTo(first);\n    later(function(){\n      cursor.press();\n      first.classList.add('pressing');\n      later(function(){\n        cursor.release();\n        first.classList.remove('pressing');\n        openPanel(0);\n        later(function(){\n          cursor.moveTo(closeBtn);\n          later(function(){\n            cursor.press();\n            closeBtn.classList.add('pressing');\n            later(function(){\n              cursor.release();\n              closeBtn.classList.remove('pressing');\n              closePanel();\n              if(typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide();\n              later(demoCycle, 1900);\n            }, 150);\n          }, 500);\n        }, 1400);\n      }, 150);\n    }, 460);\n  }\n\n  if(window.__uiInteractive){\n    /* 弹窗：交互由用户自己点，不自动跑 */\n  } else {\n    setTimeout(demoCycle, 300);\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
